Package: misoR
Title: Mixture of Sparse Poisson Factor Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Dat", "Do", email = "dodat.stats@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fit mixtures of sparse Poisson factor models using Bayesian mixture parameters and variational
    expectation maximization for the dictionary. Combines nonnegative matrix factorization initialization,
    blocked variational updates, and dictionary learning. Supports dense and
    sparse count matrices, reusable initializations, posterior summaries,
    and visualizations of observation-level factor loadings.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Matrix, methods, stats, graphics, grDevices, utils
Suggests: roxygen2, igraph, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
